  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In Fang Yuan’s aperture it resides on his back as two lightning bolt tattoos.",
        "chapters": [
          159
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It is rank three.",
        "chapters": [
          155
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In Fang Yuan’s aperture it sits on his back as two lightning-bolt tattoos. When activated, blue lightning wings form on his back and lift him into short flight.",
        "chapters": [
          159
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Its ability is to materialize a pair of thunder wings and let a Gu Master fly for a short duration.",
        "chapters": [
          155
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_master"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The wings are formed by lightning: they are fast in a straight line, but not flexible in tight turns.",
        "chapters": [
          167
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Speed is high and primeval expenditure is also high, which matters for a C grade rank three Gu Master with a small essence sea.",
        "chapters": [
          159
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan treats it as powerful temporary flight that still costs too much essence to use freely.",
        "chapters": [
          157
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In his six-classification kit he counts Thunderwings for movement, beside attack, defense, storage, and recon Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          161
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_investigative_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "It cannot run with Stealth Scales Gu at the same time. Once the rank three Thunderwings Gu is active, the rank two Stealth Scales Gu cannot hide the lightning wings.",
        "chapters": [
          165
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_stealth_scales_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "On the battlefield he flies in a straight line and reaches a fight in a few breaths, then lands to set a classmate down away from danger.",
        "chapters": [
          159
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "wolf-tide-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Against Bai clan pressure he opens eerie blue thunderwings and shoots out like lightning.",
        "chapters": [
          166
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "wolf-tide-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_bai_clan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The same wings pull him clear of an iceblade storm, then leave him inflexible when he must endure a hit while turning.",
        "chapters": [
          167
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "wolf-tide-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "When rank four Wolf Smoke Gu black mist covers him, he judges that flying up with Thunderwings Gu would clear the smoke. A lightning lycan strike then hits him: Thunder Shield Gu dies, Thunderwings Gu barely holds onto life and cannot be used, and Sky Canopy Gu is heavily injured.",
        "chapters": [
          168
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "wolf-tide-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_wolf_smoke_gu",
          "gu_thunder_shield_gu",
          "gu_sky_canopy_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "With Thunderwings Gu temporarily unusable, he runs through the forest on foot toward the village.",
        "chapters": [
          170
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "wolf-tide-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
