  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan first spots Thunder Wings Gu on a frenzy lightning wolf during the wolf tide assault on the Gu Yue clan village on Qing Mao Mountain.",
        "chapters": [
          150
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "fac_gu_yue_clan",
          "loc_qing_mao_mountain"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After he becomes a rank three elder, he chooses a Thunderwings Gu from the clan as his bestowed rank three Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          155
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Elders kill a frenzy lightning wolf and take the Gu as spoils. Fang Yuan picks that copy when the clan lets a new elder choose a rank three Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          155
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "acquisition",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The wolf-side Gu is already named Thunder Wings Gu, and it lets the beast fly for a short moment.",
        "chapters": [
          150
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "acquisition",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In the blood cave he cannot control the thunderwings as before. The clear blue thunder stains with scarlet and feels both powerful and weak at once; the Gu may drop him mid-flight.",
        "chapters": [
          183
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "blood-frenzy-corruption-and-loss",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Moving along the cave walls with Chainsaw Golden Centipede and Thunderwings Gu, the wings grow weak and lethargic. The Gu draws less primeval essence from him and begins to absorb essence from the surrounding air while growing weaker. Fang Yuan links that pattern to Blood Frenzy Gu. Without a special Gu to clean it, the half-crippled Thunderwings Gu will turn into blood water and become a new pollution source, and it starts to become uncontrollable.",
        "chapters": [
          184
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "blood-frenzy-corruption-and-loss",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_chainsaw_golden_centipede",
          "gu_blood_frenzy_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Blood Frenzy Gu pollution leaves the Thunderwings Gu unreliable, weakening it until it risks turning into blood water and becoming a new pollution source.",
        "chapters": [
          188
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "blood-frenzy-corruption-and-loss",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan forces it off his back, throws it behind him as bait, and bladewing blood bats tear it apart.",
        "chapters": [
          188
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "blood-frenzy-corruption-and-loss",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
